BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

MAYOR OF MAGELANG,

Considering:
a. that in every human being there are inherent human rights that must be respected, upheld and protected by the state, law, Regional Government and every person for the sake of honor and protection of human dignity;
